<bhuvaneśvarī pañcāṅgam rudrayāmale>
<3887>
<Extent 25 >
<ṣharada script>
<ṣubject: tantraṃ bhaktiśāstre> 

oṃsvastiprajābhyaḥ śrīgaṇeśāyanamaḥ oṃnamobhuvaneśvaryai śrīyase || ||
oṃśrīdevyuvāca devadevamahādevasarvaśāstraviśārade kapālakhaṭvāṅgadharacitā
bhasmānulepana ādyāyāprakṛtirnityāmantra(?)śāstreṣugopitā tasyāḥśrībhuvaneśvaryāḥpa
ñcāṅgaṃdevadurlabhaṃ kathayasvamahādevayathādevīprasīdati śrīmahādevuvāca ||
sādhupṛṣṭhaṃtvayādevisādhakānāṃhitāyavai yānityāprakṛtirādyāsarvaśāstreṣugopitā ya
syaśravaṇamātreṇasarvapāpaiḥpramucyate ārādhanādbhavedyasyājīvanmuktonasaṃśayaḥ atha
vakṣyejagaddhātrī(?)madhunābhuvaneśvarīṃ brahmādayonajānantipadamavyayamātmanaḥ nakule
śogninārūḍhovāmanetrocacandrayān bījamasyāsmamākhyātaṃsamastasiddhakāṅkṣitaṃ ṛṣiḥśa
ktirbhavecchandogāyatryaṃsamudīritaṃ devatāsurasaṅghenasevitābhuvaneśvarī ṣaḍdīrghayukta
bījenakuryādaṅgavikalpanā sārasvatokumārgeṇamātṛkānyastavigrahā 

<śrīḥbhuvapa 1 pṛ0 1a> mantranyāsaṃtataḥkuryāddevatābhāvasiddhaye hṛllekhāṃmurdhnivadanegaganāṃhṛdayāmbu
je raktāṃkarālikāṃguhyemahocchuṣmāṃpadadvaye ūrdhvaprāgdakṣiṇodīcyapaścimeṣu
mukheṣuca madhyādyahrasvabījāḍyānyastavyābhūtasaṃprabhāḥ aṅgānivinyasetpaścājjā
tiyuktāniṣaṭkramāt brahmaṇaṃvinyasedbhālegāyatryāsahasaṃyutaṃ sāvitryāsahi
taṃviṣṇuṃkapoledakṣiṇenyataḥ vāgīśvaryāsamāyuktaṃvāmagaṇḍemaheśvaraṃ śrī
yāgaṇapatiṃbhyaseṣaṣṭyāgaṇapatiṃtathā madhyakarṇoparimitekarṇagaṇḍānta
rālayoḥ nyastavyovadanemūlaṃpunaścaitattanaunyaset kaṇṭhamūlestanadvandvevāmāṃse
hṛdayāmbuje savyāṃsepārśvayugalenābhideśecadaiśikāḥ vāmāṃsapārśvajaṭha
repārśvāṃsāparakehṛdi brahmaṇyādyāstatonyasyāvidhināproktalakṣaṇāḥ mū
lenavyāpakaṃdehenyaseddevīṃvicintayet oṃudyaddinadyutimi
ndukirīṭāṃtuṅgakucāṃnayanatrayayuktāṃ smeramukhīṃvaradābhayapāśābhīti

<pṛ0 1ba> karāṃprabhujebhuvaneśīṃ prajapenmantravinmantraṃdvātriṃśallakṣamānataḥ trisdvādayuktai
rjuhuyādaṣṭadravyairdaśāṃśataḥ dadyādarghyaṃdineśāyatatrasaṃcintyapārvatīṃ padmama
ṣṭadalaṃdhyāyetpadmaṃṣoḍaśabhidalaiḥ vilikhetkarṇikāmadhyeṣaṭkoṇamatisunda
raṃ tataḥsaṃpūjayetpīṭhaṃnavaśaktisamanvitam jayākhyāvijayāpaścāda
jitāhyaparājitā nityāvilāsinīdogdhrāvaghorāmaṅgalānava bījādya
māsanaṃdatvāmūrtiṃtenaivakalpayet tasyāṃ saṃpūjayeddevīmāvāhyāvara
ṇaiḥkramāt madhyaprāgdakṣiṇodīcyapaścimeṣuyathākramaṃ hṛllekhādyā
ssamabhyarcyāḥ pañcabhūtasamaprabhāḥ varapāśāṅkuśābhītidhāriṇyositabhūṣaṇāḥ 
sthāneṣupūrvamukteṣupūjayedaṅgadevatāḥ ṣaṭkoṇeṣuyajenmantrībrahmaṇamapi

<śrīḥbhuva0pa0 2 pṛ0 2a> tādṛśaṃ paścānmithunadevatāḥ indrakoṇelasaddaṇḍakuṇḍikākṣagu
ṇābhayaṃ gāyatrīṃpūjayenmantrībrahmaṇamapitādṛśaṃ vāyukoṇeparaśva
kṣamālābhayavarānvitāṃ yajetsarasvatīmasthāṃrudraṃtādṛśalakṣaṇaṃ vahni
koṇeyajedratnakumbhāratnakaraṇdhrakaṃ karābhyāṃvibhrataṃpītundilaṃdhananāyakaṃ 
āliṅgyasavyahastenavāmenāmbujadhāriṇīṃ dhanaṭaṅkasamārūḍhāṃmahāla
kṣmīṃprapūjayet pāṇināramaṇāṅkasthāṃratiṃsamyaksamuccayet varu
ṇaṃmadanaṃbāṇapāśāṅkuśaśarāsanaṃ dhārayantaṃsvamāraktaṃpūjayedrakta
bhūṣaṇaṃ savyenapatimāśliṣṭavāmenotpaladhāriṇīṃ īśānepūjayetsa
myagvignarājaṃpriyānvitam sṛṇipāśadharaṃkāntāvarāṅgaspṛkkarāṅgu

<pṛ0 2ba> liṃ mādhvīpūrṇakapālāḍhyaṃvarṇarājaṃdigambaraṃ puṣkalaṃvigaladratnasphu
raccaṣakadhāriṇīṃ sindūracaṣakārāṃsamudrāmadavibhramāṃ dhṛtaraktotpalā
masyāḥ pāṇināuddhṛjaspṛśaṃ āśliṣṭakāntāmaruṇāṃpuṣṭimarceddigambaraṃ 
karṇikāyāṃnidhīpūjyoṣaṭkoṇasyāthapārśvayoḥ aṅgānikesareṣvetāḥpaścā
tpatreṣupūjayet anaṅgakusumāpaścādanaṅgakusumāturā paścādanaṅga
madanātvanaṅgamadanāturā bhuvanapālāgaganāvegācaivatataḥparaṃ śaśire
khācagaganerekhācetyaṣṭaśaktayaḥ pāśāṅkuśavarābhītidhāriṇyoruṇavi
grahāḥ śuddhāmedhāmatiḥkāntirāryāṣoḍaśaśaktayaḥ khaḍgakheṭakadhāri
ṇyaḥśyāmāpūjyāścamātaraḥ padmādbahiḥsamabhyarcyāḥ śaktayāḥpari
cārakāḥ prathamānaṅgarūpāsyādanaṅgamadanāturā madanāturācabhuvana

<śrīḥbhuvapa 3 pṛ0 3a> vegābhuvanamālikā syātpūrvamadanānaṅgavadanānaṅgamekhalā caṣakaṃtāla
vṛttaṃcatāmbulaṃchatramajjvalaṃ cāmaraṃcaṣakaṃpuṣpaṃvibhrāṇāḥkarapaṅkajaiḥ sa
rvābharaṇasaṃdīptāṃllokapālānbahiryajet pūjitesakalaidevaiḥkiṃ
punarmanujottamaiḥ mantrītrimadhuropetairhatvāśvarthasamitvaraiḥ brahmaṇaṃvaśaye
cchīghraṃpārthivānpadmahomataḥ palāśapuṣpaistatpatrairmantriṇaḥkusumaira
pi paṃcaviṃśatisaṃjaptairjalaiḥsnānairdinedine ātmānamabhiṣaṅce
dyassarvasaubhāgyavānbhavet pañcaviṃśatisaṃjaptaṃjalaṃprātaḥpibennaraḥ 
avāpyamahatīṃprajñāṃkavīnāmagraṇīrbhavet karpūrāgurusaṃyuktaṃkuṅku
maṃsādhusādhitaṃ gṛhītvātilakaṃkuryādrājavaśyamanuttamam śāli
pṛṣṭamayīṃkṛtvāputtalīṃmadhunānvitāṃ japtvāpratiṣṭhitaprāṇāṃbhakṣayedra

<pṛ0 3ba> vivāsare vaśaṃnayatirājānaṃnārīvānaramevaca kaṇṭhamātrodakesthitvāvī
kṣyatekhagataṃraviṃ trisahasraṃjapenmantraṃiṣṭakanyāṃlabhetasaḥ annaṃtanmantritaṃ
mantrībhuñjītaśrīprasiddhaye likhitaṃbhasmanāmāyāṃsasādhyaṃphala
kādiṣu tatkālaṃcarcayedyantraṃmukhaṃsūyetagarbhiṇī oṃśaktyantassthita
sādhyakarmabhuvanevahnervṛtaṃvahnibhirbāhyekoṇagataṃyataṃhariharavarṇairka
polārpitaiḥ paścāttaiḥ punarīyutairlipibhirapyāvīttamiṣṭhākṣayaṃyantraṃbhū
puramadhyagaṃtriguṇitaṃsaubhāgyasaṃpatpadaṃ|| bījāntassthitasādhyaṃnamāmi
śirasaumayārasā manmathairvītaṃvahnipuratvayerasapuṭeṣvāṣārṇabī
jatrayaṃ svātmānātmakamīhiṣehariharairābaddhagaṇḍaṃbahiḥ ṣaḍbījaira
vabaddhasandhilipibhirvītaṃgṛhābhyāṃtavāḥ oṃcintāmaṇinṛsiṃ

<śrīḥbhuva0paṃ 4 pṛ0 4a> hābhyāṃ lasatkoṇamidaṃlikhet yantraṃṣaḍguṇitaṃdivyaṃvahatāṃsarvasiddhi
daṃ oṃbījaṃvyāhṛtibhiryutaṃdvihayutadvandvevasokvoṇagaṃdaurgaṃbījamananta
relipitagairābaddhagaṇḍaṃlikhet gāyatryāraviśaktibaddhavivaraṃtriṣṭuvvṛ
taṃtattato vītaṃmātṛkayādharāpurayugesatsiṃhacintāmaṇiṃ yantraṃdine
śaguṇitaṃproktaṃrakṣāprasiddhidaṃ sarvasaubhāgyajananaṃsarvaśatrunivāra
kaṃ likhetsara (******) mādyedaleṣupyabhilikhyamāyām svarāvṛttaya
ntramidaṃvadhūnāṃputradaṃbhūmigṛhāntarasthaṃ ṣaṭkoṇamadhyepravilikhyaśa
ktiṃkoṇeṣu (***) vavilikhyabhūyaḥ sasādhyagarbhāṃvasvadhāpurasthaṃ
yantraṃbhavedvaśyakaraṃnarāṇāṃ oṃvāgbhavaṃśambhuvanitāramābījatrayātmakaṃ 
mantraṃsamuddharenmantrītrivargaphalasādhanaṃ ṣaḍdīrghabhājamadhyenavāgbha

<pṛ0 4ba> vāḍhyenakalpayet ṣaḍaṅgānimanoramyayāniyuktānimantravit kuryātpūrvoci
tānnyāsāṃstavaṃtatrāpisādhakāḥ oṃsindūrāruṇavigrahaṃtrinayanomāṇi
kyamaulisphurattārānāyakaśekharāṃsmitamukhīṃāpīnavakṣoruhāṃ pāṇi
bhyāmapipūrṇaratnacaṣakaṃraktotpalaṃbibhratīṃ saumyāṃraktaghaṭasthasavyacara
ṇāṃdhyāyetparāmambikāṃ ravilakṣaṃjapenmantrīpāyasairmadhuraplavaiḥ daśāṃ
śaṃdhvāhuyānmantrīpīṭheprāgauriteyajet devīṃprāguktamārgeṇagandhādyai
ratiśobhanaiḥ hutvāpalāśakusumairvākpriyaṃmahatīṃvrajet brahmaghṛtaṃ
pibejjaptaṃkavitvaṃvatsvarānbhavet siddharthāllavaṇopetānhutvāmantrīvaśaṃ
nayet naranārīṃnarapatiṃnātrakāryāvicāraṇā caturaṅgulaiḥpuṣpaiśca
candanāmbhasmamukṣitaiḥ hutvāvaśīkarotyāśutryailokyamapisādhakāḥ 

<śrīḥbhuva0paṃ0 5 pṛ0 5a> juhuyādaruṇāmbhojairayutaṃmadhuraplutaiḥ rājyaśriyamavāpnotisatilaistaṇḍulai
stathā prāguktānyapikarmāṇimantreṇānenamārayet vāgbījapuṭitāmā
yāvidyeyaṃtryakṣarīmatā madhyenadīrghayuktenavākuṭasthenakalpayet a
ṅgānijātiyuktānikrameṇamantravittamaḥ yathāpurāsamudiṣṭaṃnyāsaṃku
rvītamantravit|| oṃśyāmāṅgīṃśaśiśekharāṃnijakarairdānaṃcarakto
tpalaiḥ ratnāḍhyāṃcaṣakaṃvaraṃbhayaharaṃsaṃvibhratīṃśāśvataṃ muktāhāralasatpa
yodharanatāṃnetratrayollāsinīṃ vandehaṃsvarapūjitāṃharavadhuṃraktāravinda
sthitāṃ tatvalakṣaṃjapenmantraṃjuhuyāttadaśāṃśataḥ palāśapuṣpaistatpatrai
puṣpairvārājavṛkṣakaiḥ hṛllekhāvihitepīṭhepūjayetparameśvarīṃ madyādi
pūjayenmantrīhṛllekhādyāḥpurohitāḥ mithunāniyajenmantrīṣaṭkoṇe

<pṛ0 5ba> ṣuyathāpurā aṅgapūjākesareṣupūjyāḥpatreṣumātaraḥ bhairavāṅkasamārū
ḍhāḥsmeravaktrāmadālasāḥ asitāṅgoruruścaṇḍaḥkrodhaśconmattasaṃjñakaḥ 
kapālībhīṣaṇaḥpaścāsaṃhāraścāṣṭabhairavāḥ śūlaṃkapālaṃprītaṃcabi
bhrāṇāḥkṣudradundubhiṃ gaṇatvagambarābhīmāḥkuṭilālakaśobhinaḥ 
dīrghādyāmātaraḥproktāhrasvādyābhairavāḥsmṛtāḥ pūjyāḥṣoḍaśapatreṣu
karālādyāḥpurohitāḥ tadbāhyenaṅgarūpāḍhyālokeśāstrāṇita
dbahiḥ evamārādhayeddevīṃśāstroktenaivavartmanā vaśaṃnayatirājā
naṃvanitāścamadālasāḥ annamāṇyenajuhuyāllabhatevasavāñchitaṃ 
sugandhaiḥkusumaibhyuśvaśriyamāpnotivāñchitāṃ mantreṇānenasaṃjapta
maśnīyādannaṃyobahu bhavedarogīnaya vāndīrghamāyuravāpnuyāt 

<śrīḥbhuvapaṃ0 6 pṛ0 6a> anantobindusaṃyuktomāyāṃbrahmāgnitāravān māyāditryakṣaromantraḥ
sarvavaśyaphalapradaḥ ṛṣyādyaḥpūrvamuktāḥsyādbījenāṅgakriyāmatā 
oṃvarāṅkuśaupāśamabhītimudrāṃkarairvahantīṃkamalāsanasthāṃ bālā
rkakoṭipratimāṃtrinetrāṃbhajehamādyāṃbhuvanīśvarīṃtāṃ haviṣyabhugja
penmantraṃtatvalakṣaṃjitendriyaḥ tatsahasraprajuhuyājapāntemantravitta
maḥ dadhikṣaudraghṛtāktābhiḥsamidbhiḥkṣīrabhūruhāṃ tatsaṃkhyayā
tilaiḥśuddhaiḥpayasāktairjuhuyāttataḥ hṛllekhāvahitepīṭhanava
śaktisamanvite arcayetparameśānīṃvakṣyamānakrameṇatāṃ indrā
dayaḥ pannaḥpūjyasteṣāmastrāṇitadbahiḥ evaṃsaṃpūjayeddevī
sākṣādvaiśravaṇobhavet pūjyatesakalaiḥlokaistejasābhāskaropamaḥ 

<pṛ0 6ba> anantādhiṣṭhitaṃgehaṃniśidīpaśikhākulaṃ dṛśyateprāṇibhiḥsarvairmantrasyā
syaprabhāvataḥ sarṣapairlājasaṃmiśrairājyārthījuhuyānniśi rājānaṃvaśayetsadyāḥ
tatpatnīmapisādhakaḥ annavānannahomenaśrīmānpadmahutobhavet rājavṛkṣa
samudbhūtaiḥpuṣpaihutvākavirbhavet arogītilahomenaghṛtenāyuravāpnuyāt 
prāguktāṇyapikarmāṇisādhayetsādhakottamaiḥ oṃālikhyāṣṭadigargalānyu
daragaṃdhāśāṭhikaṃtryakṣaraṃkoṣṭheṣvaṅgamanūnpareṣuvilikhyedaṣṭābhamantra
dvayaṃ abhyubāparaṣaṭkayugmadhuvaravyomāsanānargaleṣvālikhyendrajalādhipādi
guṇaśaḥ paṅktidvayātatparaṃ koṣṭheṣuṣvayugārṇamātmasamatāṃyugmasvagantargatāṃ
māyāṃkesaragāṃdaleṣuvilikhenmūlaṃtripaṅktikramāt triḥpāśāṅkuśave
ṣṭitalipibhirāvītaṃkramādvyutkramātpadmasthenaghaṭenapaṅkajamukhenāveṣṭi
taṃtadbahiḥghaṭārgalamidaṃmantraṃmantriṇāṃprāvṛtamataṃ pāśaśrī

<śrīḥbhuvaśvapa0 7 pṛ0 7a> śaktikārānda (**) kāmaśaktirdiśāṅkuśaḥ prathamoṣṭākṣaromantraḥtataḥkāminirañjini
svāhāntoṣṭākṣaraḥsadbhiraparaḥkīrtitomanuḥ hrīṃgaurirudradayiteyogīśvarisa
varmaphaṭ dvidhāntaṣṣoḍaśārṇoyaṃmantraḥsadbhirudīritaḥ likhitvābhūrjapatrā
dauyantrametadyathāvidhi dhārayedvāmabāhauvākaṇṭhevānijamūrdhani vaśayetsaka
lāndevānviśveṣeṇamahīpatīn nīlapaṭṭevilikhyaitadguṭikaukṛtyatatpunaḥ 
sādhyapratikṛtesiktanirmitāyāhṛdinyaset pātretrimadhurāpūrṇenikṣi
pyaināṃvidhānavit saṃkṣipyagandhapuṣpādyaiḥbaliṃnikṣipyarātriṣu mūlamantraṃja
penmantrīnityamaṣṭasahasrakaṃ saptāhādbāñchitāṃnārīmākarṣansmaravihvalāṃ 
bhūrjapatrevilikhyaitadguṭikākṛtyatatpunaḥ lākṣayātāmrarajatakāñcanairveṣṭa
yetkramāt tatkumbhenyasyasaṃpūjyayathāvadbhuvaneśvarīṃ saṃspṛśyaitāṃjapenmantraṃdivā
karasahasrakaṃ abhiṣiñcyapriyaṃsādhyavadhnīyādghaṭasannidhau kāntipuṣṭi

<pṛ0 7ba> dharārogyaśreyāṃsilabhatenaraḥ bhittauvilikhyatadyantraṃpūjayennityamādarāt bhū
tapretapiśācāstenavīkṣitumapikṣamāḥ tadvilikhyaśirastrāṇesādhayeddhā
ritaṃbhaṭaḥ yuddheripūnbahūnhatvājayamāpnotipārthivaḥ vajrāṅkitevahnipuredva
yetāṃpāśāṅkuśāḍhyāṃudarasthasādyāṃ madhyeṣṭakoṇeṣvacabāhyapadmaiḥ punaḥpu
nastāṃvilikhetsamantrāṃ bhūrjelikhitametatsyātsarvavaśyaṅkaraṃparaṃ ārogyaiśvaryajana
naṃyuddheṣvavijayapradaṃ likhetsarojesukaresvarāḍhyevargāṣṭapattrevasudhāpurasthe
pāśāṅkuśābhyāṃguṇaśaḥprabodhāṃ māyāṃlikhenmadhyagatāṃsamādyāṃ sarveṣāṃ
svamidaṃmantraṃdhāritaṃkurutenṛṇāṃ ārogyaiśvaryasaubhāgyaṃvijayādīnanārataṃ 
[itiśrīrudrayāmaletantredaśavidyārahasyabhuvaneśvarīpaṭalaṃsamāptam]|| 
|| śubhaṃ|| 

<śrīḥbhuva0śva0pa0 8 pṛ0 8a> oṃathavakṣyejagaddhātrīmadhunābhuvaneśvarīṃ brahmādayopiyāṃjñātvālebhireśriyamuttamāṃ 
athapūjāvidhiṃvakṣyesarvakāmārthasiddhaye brāhmyemuharteutthāyabaddhapadmāsanaḥ 
svaśirasisahasradalakamaleguruṃdhyāyet prātaḥśirasiśuklābjetrinetraṃvi
malaṃguruṃ varābhayakaraṃśāntaṃsmarettannāmapūrvakaṃ itidhyātvāmānasopacārai
rabhyarcyapraṇamet akhaṇḍamaṇḍalākāraṃvyāptaṃyenacarācaraṃ tatpadaṃdarśitaṃ
yenatasmaiśrīguravenamaḥ tatohṛtpadmedevīṃdhyāyet oṃudyaddinakṛddyuti
mindukirīṭāṃtuṅgakucāṃnayanatrayayuktāṃ smeramukhīṃvaradāṅkuśapāśā
bhītikarīṃprabhajebhuvaneśīm itidhyātvā mūlaṃdaśadhājaptvānamaskṛ
tyātmānaṃtaddrūpaṃvibhāvyāvaśyakārthaṃbahirgacchet tatāgatyanadyādaugatvā
malaviśodhanaṃ snānaṃkṛtvā tilakuśamādāyaśrīparadevatārcanayogyatā

<pṛ0 8ba> siddhyarthaṃsnānamahaṅkariṣye itisaṅkalpyatrirnimajjyorthāyamūlaṃjapan kumbhamudrayāśrī
